  "scenario": "Forecast",
  "description": "Forecast places unfinished tasks on days by their effective defer and due dates, in the device's time zone: Past (due before today), Today (always), each of the next 14 days with a date falling on it, then Future. Each heading splits into Due and Deferred, earliest first. A task appears on each day one of its dates falls on, once under Due when both fall on the same day. Completed tasks and defer dates before today place nothing. “Quarterly report” has a blocked task due on Thursday with a prerequisite beneath it; “Move house” is paused, deferred and due, which its task inherits. See “Forecast” in the spec.",
